{"id":"ba0adc4f8f4a1bbd","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-translation.md","title":"Relative Arithmetic Translation","display":"df-translation — Relative Arithmetic Translation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-translation","aliases":["67-df-translation"],"display":"df-translation — Relative Arithmetic Translation","depends_on":["[[67-df-arithmetic-language]]","[[67-df-formula]]","[[67-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[67-df-predicate-logic]]","[[67-df-strong-godel-encoding]]"],"source_scope":"第 6 章 §1，印刷页 75–76；PDF 第 86–87 页","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","source_proof_status":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"inherited_verification_status":"source-statement-checked","inherited_source_proof_status":"不适用（定义）","machine_verified":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-translation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-translation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-translation — Relative Arithmetic Translation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"97e929795d778cd6\" href=\"?note=97e929795d778cd6\" title=\"67-df-arithmetic-language\">67-df-arithmetic-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"55353aba49d6b3f2\" href=\"?note=55353aba49d6b3f2\" title=\"67-df-primitive-recursive\">67-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9a1432082607876a\" href=\"?note=9a1432082607876a\" title=\"67-df-predicate-logic\">67-df-predicate-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"第 6 章 §1，印刷页 75–76；PDF 第 86–87 页"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"不适用（定义）"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_A=L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(L_A=L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{L_A}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{L_A}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\)</span>、同时无捕获代入及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_A}\">\\(\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_A}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"97e929795d778cd6\" href=\"?note=97e929795d778cd6\" title=\"67-df-arithmetic-language\">67-df-arithmetic-language</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2035a1f4d72e7df9\" href=\"?note=2035a1f4d72e7df9\" title=\"67-df-formula\">67-df-formula</a>。下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z,u\">\\(x,y,z,u\\)</span> 遍历变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\)</span> 遍历算术公式。对象量词的域由公式中的相对化指定。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu:\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\to N_A\">\\(\\nu:\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\to N_A\\)</span> 是满足下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Norm}_A(\\nu)\">\\(\\mathrm{Norm}_A(\\nu)\\)</span> 的固定消去复合项的原始递归规范化参数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_A\">\\(N_A\\)</span> 在下式构造。要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu|_{N_A}=\\mathrm{id}\">\\(\\nu|_{N_A}=\\mathrm{id}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{free}(\\nu\\varphi)=\\operatorname{free}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\operatorname{free}(\\nu\\varphi)=\\operatorname{free}(\\varphi)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_A}(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\nu\\varphi)\">\\(\\vdash\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_A}(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\nu\\varphi)\\)</span>，并与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg,\\land,\\forall x\">\\(\\neg,\\land,\\forall x\\)</span> 的原始构造交换。这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{free}=\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}\">\\(\\operatorname{free}=\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}\\)</span>。规范化步骤的新变量按固定的新鲜变量规则选择。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 是候选公式函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v_0]\">\\(\\mu\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v_0]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_0\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v_0]\">\\(\\eta_0\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v_0]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_S\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v_0,v_1]\">\\(\\eta_S\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v_0,v_1]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_+,\\eta_\\times\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v_0,v_1,v_2]\">\\(\\eta_+,\\eta_\\times\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v_0,v_1,v_2]\\)</span> 为下式量化的参数；应用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(x),\\eta_S(x,y)\">\\(\\mu(x),\\eta_S(x,y)\\)</span> 等使用无捕获代入。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=(\\mu,\\eta_0,\\eta_S,\\eta_+,\\eta_\\times)\">\\(D=(\\mu,\\eta_0,\\eta_S,\\eta_+,\\eta_\\times)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TD}(\\tau,D)\">\\(\\mathrm{TD}(\\tau,D)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trans}_{L_A,L_A}(\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{Trans}_{L_A,L_A}(\\tau)\\)</span> 在下式定义。这里允许自由变量只是指定变量表的子集。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=c_{L_A}\">\\(g=c_{L_A}\\)</span>，另固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_\\nu\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_1\">\\(e_\\nu\\in\\mathrm{PRProg}_1\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦ e_\\nu⟧(g(\\varphi))=g(\\nu\\varphi)\">\\(⟦ e_\\nu⟧(g(\\varphi))=g(\\nu\\varphi)\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\)</span>），非法公式码取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Norm}_A(\\nu)\">\\(\\mathrm{Norm}_A(\\nu)\\)</span> 是显式前提；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathrm{PL}}\">\\(\\vdash_{\\mathrm{PL}}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9a1432082607876a\" href=\"?note=9a1432082607876a\" title=\"67-df-predicate-logic\">67-df-predicate-logic</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nA_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x=y,x=0,Sx=y,x+y=z,x\\times y=z:x,y,z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L_A}\\},\\\\\nN_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}:A_A\\subseteq X\n\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in X\\ (\\neg\\varphi\\in X\\land(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in X)\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L_A}\\ \\forall\\varphi\\in X\\ (\\forall x\\varphi\\in X)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal P_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v_0]\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v_0]\\times\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v_0,v_1]\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v_0,v_1,v_2]\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v_0,v_1,v_2].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nA_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x=y,x=0,Sx=y,x+y=z,x\\times y=z:x,y,z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L_A}\\},\\\\\nN_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}:A_A\\subseteq X\n\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in X\\ (\\neg\\varphi\\in X\\land(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in X)\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L_A}\\ \\forall\\varphi\\in X\\ (\\forall x\\varphi\\in X)\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal P_A&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v_0]\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v_0]\\times\n\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v_0,v_1]\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v_0,v_1,v_2]\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}[v_0,v_1,v_2].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Norm}_A(\\nu)\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;\n\\nu:\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\to N_A\\land\\nu\\upharpoonright N_A=\\mathrm{id}_{N_A}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\\n(\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\nu\\varphi)=\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\varphi)\\land\n\\varnothing\\vdash_{\\mathrm{PL}}\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_A}(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\nu\\varphi))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\\n(\\nu(\\neg\\varphi)=\\neg\\nu(\\varphi)\\land\\nu(\\varphi\\land\\psi)=\\nu(\\varphi)\\land\\nu(\\psi))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L_A}\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\\n\\nu(\\forall x\\varphi)=\\forall x\\nu(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{TD}(\\tau,D)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n&amp;D\\in\\mathcal P_A\\land\\tau:\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi\\ (\\tau(\\varphi)=\\tau(\\nu\\varphi))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y,z\\ \\bigl(\n\\tau(x=y)=(x=y)\\land\\tau(x=0)=\\eta_0(x)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{5em}\\land\\tau(Sx=y)=\\eta_S(x,y)\n\\land\\tau(x+y=z)=\\eta_+(x,y,z)\n\\land\\tau(x\\times y=z)=\\eta_\\times(x,y,z)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\ \\bigl(\\tau(\\neg\\varphi)=\\neg\\tau(\\varphi)\n\\land\\tau(\\varphi\\land\\psi)=\\tau(\\varphi)\\land\\tau(\\psi)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\ \\forall\\varphi\\\n\\bigl(\\tau(\\forall x\\varphi)=\\forall x(\\mu(x)\\to\\tau(\\varphi))\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Trans}_{L_A,L_A}(\\tau)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n&amp;\\exists D\\in\\mathcal P_A\\ \\mathrm{TD}(\\tau,D).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Norm}_A(\\nu)\\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;\n\\nu:\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\to N_A\\land\\nu\\upharpoonright N_A=\\mathrm{id}_{N_A}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\\n(\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\nu\\varphi)=\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\varphi)\\land\n\\varnothing\\vdash_{\\mathrm{PL}}\\operatorname{ucl}_{L_A}(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\nu\\varphi))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\\n(\\nu(\\neg\\varphi)=\\neg\\nu(\\varphi)\\land\\nu(\\varphi\\land\\psi)=\\nu(\\varphi)\\land\\nu(\\psi))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{L_A}\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\\n\\nu(\\forall x\\varphi)=\\forall x\\nu(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\mathrm{TD}(\\tau,D)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n&amp;D\\in\\mathcal P_A\\land\\tau:\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi\\ (\\tau(\\varphi)=\\tau(\\nu\\varphi))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y,z\\ \\bigl(\n\\tau(x=y)=(x=y)\\land\\tau(x=0)=\\eta_0(x)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{5em}\\land\\tau(Sx=y)=\\eta_S(x,y)\n\\land\\tau(x+y=z)=\\eta_+(x,y,z)\n\\land\\tau(x\\times y=z)=\\eta_\\times(x,y,z)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\ \\bigl(\\tau(\\neg\\varphi)=\\neg\\tau(\\varphi)\n\\land\\tau(\\varphi\\land\\psi)=\\tau(\\varphi)\\land\\tau(\\psi)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\ \\forall\\varphi\\\n\\bigl(\\tau(\\forall x\\varphi)=\\forall x(\\mu(x)\\to\\tau(\\varphi))\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Trans}_{L_A,L_A}(\\tau)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n&amp;\\exists D\\in\\mathcal P_A\\ \\mathrm{TD}(\\tau,D).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节保留的原书页码、既往核对记录及证明说明来自输入档案；本次未提供原书 PDF，以下既往记录不表示本次重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>原书的解释使用可定义子域，故量词必须相对化到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>；旧稿未经相对化的交换律把论域限制删掉了。为兼容既有第 90 本语法，本原子用原始 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\">\\(\\forall\\)</span> 给出守卫式；由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x\\varphi=\\neg\\forall x\\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\exists x\\varphi=\\neg\\forall x\\neg\\varphi\\)</span>，其存在量词翻译逻辑等价于原书的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x(\\mu(x)\\land\\tau\\varphi)\">\\(\\exists x(\\mu(x)\\land\\tau\\varphi)\\)</span>。两种逻辑基底的公式不作逐字相同的断言。本原子固定书中保等号、一维的算术版本，不声称涵盖所有语言或商解释。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_A\">\\(N_A\\)</span> 的构造按有限公式树深度闭合；每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 在该语法上唯一确定翻译，再通过固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> 延伸到任意公式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> 是明确列出契约的预处理参数，不是从翻译公理中暗中推断的函数。原书例子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x+0=y\">\\(x+0=y\\)</span> 先变为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists z(z=0\\land x+z=y)\">\\(\\exists z(z=0\\land x+z=y)\\)</span>。变量实例和绑定变量改名始终无捕获。</p>\n<p>来源陈述已逐条核对，并查看 PDF 第 86 页图像确认 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span> 及函数元数。来源中的 “Clearly <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> is primitive recursive” 在固定的有效语法编码和原始递归规范化下适用；只假定递归解码的任意编号不能得到这一结论。</p>\n<p>来源：Per Lindström, <em>Aspects of Incompleteness</em>，原档案所引 PDF；第 6 章 §1，印刷页 75–76；PDF 第 86–87 页。</p>\n<p>证明核验范围：不适用（定义）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"97e929795d778cd6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetic-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2035a1f4d72e7df9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-primitive-recursive","status"